        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "F. The joint MCCSSE/MCPS committee for the purpose of reviewing periodically the Employee Benefit Plan shall be continued and shall make recommendations to the parties when warranted. Each party shall appoint three (3) members of the committee.",
            "block_bbox": [
                60,
