        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "H. 1. The Joint Health Care Cost Containment Committee shall continue for the duration of this agreement. Such committee shall be composed of three (3) members from each side, including the president of MCCSSE and the director of association relations for MCPS. The committee shall monitor the performance of the health care cost containment firm responsible for effecting cost containment measures approved by the committee.",
            "block_bbox": [
                58,
                373,
                712,
                521
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    58.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    712.0,
                    373.0
                ],
                [
                    712.0,
                    521.0
                ],
                [
                    58.0,
                    521.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The firm's objective will be to control costs and thereby the premiums paid by the Board and the supporting services employees. The firm will look at various cost control techniques, such as mandatory preadmission testing, mandatory outpatient surgery, utilization review, restrictions on weekend and holiday admissions, claims control and administrative cost control.",
            "block_bbox": [
                122,
                533,
                714,
                677
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    122.0,
                    533.0
                ],
                [
                    714.0,
                    533.0
                ],
                [
                    714.0,
                    677.0
                ],
                [
                    122.0,
                    677.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. In addition, the committee shall do the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                97,
                690,
                533,
                714
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    97.0,
                    690.0
                ],
                [
                    533.0,
                    690.0
                ],
                [
                    533.0,
                    714.0
                ],
                [
                    97.0,
                    714.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a) The committee shall establish mechanisms, criteria, and procedures to require hospitals, doctors, and other providers of health care services to MCPS employees to measure outcomes of treatment, to demonstrate the quality of their care, and to disclose the cost of such care.",
            "block_bbox": [
                124,
                727,
                714,
                826
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    124.0,
                    727.0
                ],
                [
                    714.0,
                    727.0
                ],
                [
                    714.0,
                    826.0
                ],
                [
                    124.0,
                    826.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b) The committee shall analyze the efficiency of doctors, hospitals, and other providers of health care services to MCPS employees. For purposes of this article, efficiency means favorable medical outcomes at reasonable cost.",
            "block_bbox": [
                124,
                837,
                714,
                933
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    124.0,
                    837.0
                ],
                [
                    714.0,
                    837.0
                ],
                [
                    714.0,
                    933.0
                ],
                [
                    124.0,
                    933.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c) The committee shall publicize the results of the efficiency analysis so that MCPS employees become more knowledgeable consumers of health care services.",
            "block_bbox": [
                125,
                945,
                715,
                1017
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
